# Anatomical side

Footprint-frame mesh Y: medial is −Y on the left foot and +Y on the right. Lateral is the opposite. Mirror means medial-to-medial and lateral-to-lateral, never the same world Y on both feet.

All element and sink placement uses `meshYForAnatomicalSide` / `meshYSign` in `vertex/src/lib/geometry/handedness.ts`. Declare `anatomicalSide` on the element or sink profile. Do not add a private left/right Y flip.

Every placed element and every placed sink must be visible in the Elements viewer (planform or surface color), not gizmo-only.

New kinds are covered by `vertex/src/lib/geometry/anatomical-side.test.ts`, which walks the element and sink registries, plus a viewer overlay assertion.
